From 1ca19b3f5a13ab821e16b540c8462790548bd392 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Destrudos6 <3411622425@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 22:10:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Rebrand the app as BiPipe

- Replace launcher icons with the new BiPipe artwork in all densities,
  scaling the adaptive foreground into the 66% safe zone so the
  antennas survive launcher masks, and clearing the source watermark
- Change the adaptive icon background to white and drop the legacy
  monochrome layer tied to the old logo
- Rename the app to BiPipe in all build variants via resValue
- Rewrite the About screen: new BiPipe description, contribution
  section pointing to the PipePipe-Bisub repository, and an
  acknowledgements section linking both PipePipe and NewPipe
- Remove the Ko-Fi donation entries from the About screen and proxy
  settings, along with their unused strings and preference key
